          <Pad Id="MO7ohpQexF1ww48Le2rvnH" Bounds="580,330,320,80" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&lt; Contains(A, B) and Within(B, A) are always equal: the same question, asked from the other side. Note B is wired to Within's first pin.">
